@ifnottex
@node Top
@top elpaca-build-augment

An extension for @uref{https://github.com/progfolio/elpaca, Elpaca} that runs the
per-package build steps GNU/NonGNU ELPA and MELPA run on their build
servers. Without it@comma{} packages that rely on those steps install from source
in an incomplete state.

